      "text": "Lithium label:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " monotx for bipolar I (acute manic and mixed episodes) in pts ≥ 7 y; boxed warning: toxicity tracks serum levels and can occur @ doses close to therapeutic; serum lithium testing must be available b4 starting."
     }
    ]
   },
